        "original_id": "5bbe1fc6-5f23-5635-99a1-add8fee2d16e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: True Williams, Tom Sawyer, Huckleberry Finn, Mark Twain\n- Works: The Adventures of Tom Sawyer\n- Topics: Illustration, Fictional characters\n\nFacts:\n- In 1876, Mark Twain's novel \"The Adventures of Tom Sawyer\" was published.\n- In 1876, True Williams drew all illustrations for the first edition of \"The Adventures of Tom Sawyer.\"\n- True Williams was the first illustrator to depict the characters Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn.\n- Tom Sawyer is the title character of Mark Twain's novel \"The Adventures of Tom Sawyer.\"",
